data: {"id": "1c62a2bcc92f4dcf-thinking-parallel_evidence-2180", "run_id": "1c62a2bcc92f4dcf", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我已阅读上下文归档并确认：前期采集已覆盖 kubectl_describe、kubectl_get_yaml、kubectl_logs、kubectl_events、PromQL（kube_pod_status_ready）、pod topology，以及 logs_grep(503)。所有事实一致指向同一 Pod（UID `13aa0496-5af5-4103-882f-2a096df0dc3f`），时间窗在 2026-09-07 19:01–20:31 UTC 内。\n\n## 本轮证据总结（仅用于判断 NotReady 的直接原因）\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l`\n- **UID**: `13aa0496-5af5-4103-882f-2a096df0dc3f`（未发生身份复用）\n- **Phase**: Running（容器进程正在运行）\n- **Node**: node2 (10.2.0.50)\n- **Image**: `xnet.registry.io:8443/ob", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788813169223, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

